WEBVTT

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.976
And what did we do home alone?

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.239
We bought one military
and we operated another.

00:12:04.263 --> 00:12:06.644
It's like the guy who goes
to the doctor and says,

00:12:06.668 --> 00:12:08.976
"Doctor, it hurts when I do this."

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.976
(Laughter)

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.976
The doctor says, "Stop
doing that you idiot."

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.976
I used to give this brief
inside the Pentagon in the early 1990s.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.976
I'd say, "You're buying one military
and you're operating another,

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.191
and eventually it's going to hurt.
It's wrong.

00:12:21.215 --> 00:12:22.976
Bad Pentagon, bad!"

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.976
(Laughter)

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.239
And they'd say, "Dr.
Barnett, you are so right.

00:12:27.263 --> 00:12:29.597
Can you come back next year
and remind us again?"

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:34.976
(Laughter)